        ['id'=>9853,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>316,'title'=>'Diplomatic Breakthrough: Turkey and Beijing Sign Historic Agreement','exc'=>'Economic pressure and international isolation are beginning to take a toll, with the currency losing 250 percent of its value against the dollar in recent weeks.','body'=>'<p>The developments unfolded rapidly over a 25-hour period, catching observers off guard and prompting urgent consultations among stakeholders who had been tracking the situation for weeks.</p><p>Sources familiar with the matter said that background discussions had been under way for some time, but that the speed of the final decision surprised even those closest to the process.</p><p>Reactions were swift. Analysts noted that the implications would likely reverberate well beyond the immediate context, touching on a range of related issues that had previously been treated as separate.</p><p>Officials declined to provide detailed comment, citing the sensitivity of ongoing processes, but indicated that further announcements were expected within days.</p>','cat'=>'World News','author'=>'Marcus Webb','img'=>'','tags'=>['Africa','Development','Aid'],'date'=>'2022-08-06 15:09:00'],
        ['id'=>9854,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>4742,'title'=>'Arctic Council Suspended Over the UN Military Activities','exc'=>'Emergency aid totalling 200 million dollars was pledged by the international community, though experts warned that logistical barriers could delay its delivery.','body'=>'<p>The findings emerged from a process that had been years in the making, drawing on data, testimony, and analysis assembled painstakingly from dozens of independent sources.</p><p>Those involved described it as one of the most complex undertakings they had been part of, requiring sustained coordination across multiple disciplines, jurisdictions, and institutional cultures.</p><p>The significance of what had been uncovered was not lost on the participants, who were careful to present their conclusions in measured terms while making clear the weight of evidence behind them.</p><p>What comes next remains contested, but few doubted that the moment marked a turning point from which simple return to the previous state of affairs would be difficult, perhaps impossible.</p>','cat'=>'World News','author'=>'James Carver','img'=>'','tags'=>['Sanctions','Trade','Diplomacy'],'date'=>'2022-03-31 19:20:00'],
