        ['id'=>10226,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>3134,'title'=>'Luxury Sector Booms Despite Malaysia Economic Slowdown','exc'=>'Small business owners described the pressure as unprecedented, with energy costs, wage increases, and reduced consumer spending squeezing margins from every direction.','body'=>'<p>The findings emerged from a process that had been years in the making, drawing on data, testimony, and analysis assembled painstakingly from dozens of independent sources.</p><p>Those involved described it as one of the most complex undertakings they had been part of, requiring sustained coordination across multiple disciplines, jurisdictions, and institutional cultures.</p><p>The significance of what had been uncovered was not lost on the participants, who were careful to present their conclusions in measured terms while making clear the weight of evidence behind them.</p><p>What comes next remains contested, but few doubted that the moment marked a turning point from which simple return to the previous state of affairs would be difficult, perhaps impossible.</p>','cat'=>'Business','author'=>'Claire Dupont','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611532736597-de2d4265fba3?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Startup','Venture','Tech'],'date'=>'2025-05-21 19:32:00'],
