        ['id'=>10785,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>3527,'title'=>'Social Media Algorithm Change by Tencent Hits Small Publishers Hard','exc'=>'The incident highlighted the fragility of critical digital infrastructure, with outages cascading across interconnected platforms and affecting tens of millions of users.','body'=>'<p>Numbers tell part of the story. The figures, released alongside a detailed technical appendix, showed trends that had been suspected but whose magnitude surprised even seasoned observers in the field.</p><p>Statisticians cautioned against over-interpretation of any single data point, noting that short-term fluctuations can obscure more fundamental patterns that only become visible over longer time horizons.</p><p>What the data could not capture, participants pointed out, was the human dimension — the lived experience of those whose circumstances were reflected in the rows and columns of the official record.</p><p>Further analysis is under way, and additional findings are expected to be published in the coming months as a fuller picture takes shape.</p>','cat'=>'Technology','author'=>'Jason Liu','img'=>'','tags'=>['AI','Machine Learning','Innovation'],'date'=>'2022-04-13 05:08:00'],
