        ['id'=>10910,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>159,'title'=>'The Google Minute Morning Routine Transforming Productivity','exc'=>'Environmental factors, including air quality, access to green space, and noise pollution, emerged as more significant contributors to wellbeing than previously accounted for in models.','body'=>'<p>Numbers tell part of the story. The figures, released alongside a detailed technical appendix, showed trends that had been suspected but whose magnitude surprised even seasoned observers in the field.</p><p>Statisticians cautioned against over-interpretation of any single data point, noting that short-term fluctuations can obscure more fundamental patterns that only become visible over longer time horizons.</p><p>What the data could not capture, participants pointed out, was the human dimension — the lived experience of those whose circumstances were reflected in the rows and columns of the official record.</p><p>Further analysis is under way, and additional findings are expected to be published in the coming months as a fuller picture takes shape.</p>','cat'=>'Lifestyle','author'=>'Tariq Farouk','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1495385379893-73cc3d84a14e?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Finance','Personal','Budgeting'],'date'=>'2024-02-16 06:58:00'],
