        ['id'=>10962,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>1994,'title'=>'Microplastics Found in 30 Percent of Food Samples Tested','exc'=>'Psychologists noted that the pressure to perform wellness, amplified by social media, can itself become a source of anxiety, particularly among adolescents and young adults.','body'=>'<p>The developments unfolded rapidly over a 30-hour period, catching observers off guard and prompting urgent consultations among stakeholders who had been tracking the situation for weeks.</p><p>Sources familiar with the matter said that background discussions had been under way for some time, but that the speed of the final decision surprised even those closest to the process.</p><p>Reactions were swift. Analysts noted that the implications would likely reverberate well beyond the immediate context, touching on a range of related issues that had previously been treated as separate.</p><p>Officials declined to provide detailed comment, citing the sensitivity of ongoing processes, but indicated that further announcements were expected within days.</p>','cat'=>'Lifestyle','author'=>'Isabella Rossi','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540189549336-e7268851650a?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Fashion','Style','Trends'],'date'=>'2024-11-24 21:25:00'],
        ['id'=>10963,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>766,'title'=>'Addis Ababa% of Adults Cannot Afford Geneva as Cost of Living Bites','exc'=>'Experts said the shift reflected a generational reordering of priorities, with younger adults placing greater weight on flexibility, autonomy, and work-life balance than their predecessors.','body'=>'<p>The story began quietly enough, in the margins of an event that had attracted little wider notice, but it quickly gathered momentum as more details came to light and more voices entered the conversation.</p><p>By the time the full extent of the matter became apparent, it had already begun to reshape perceptions and trigger a reappraisal of assumptions that had gone largely unchallenged for years.</p><p>Those who had been raising concerns for some time said they were relieved that the issue was finally receiving the attention it deserved, while cautioning that recognition was only a first step.</p><p>The road ahead will require sustained effort, adequate resources, and a willingness to have difficult conversations — all of which have historically proven harder to sustain than the initial burst of interest suggests.</p>','cat'=>'Lifestyle','author'=>'Zoe Williams','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1414235077428-338140e9d6ce?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Finance','Personal','Budgeting'],'date'=>'2023-02-14 18:47:00'],
