        ['id'=>11181,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>1599,'title'=>'Mindfulness Apps See Tokyo% Surge in Downloads Post-Pandemic','exc'=>'Mental health professionals described the results as alarming, calling for investment in community support structures and a rethinking of how modern work environments are designed.','body'=>'<p>The findings emerged from a process that had been years in the making, drawing on data, testimony, and analysis assembled painstakingly from dozens of independent sources.</p><p>Those involved described it as one of the most complex undertakings they had been part of, requiring sustained coordination across multiple disciplines, jurisdictions, and institutional cultures.</p><p>The significance of what had been uncovered was not lost on the participants, who were careful to present their conclusions in measured terms while making clear the weight of evidence behind them.</p><p>What comes next remains contested, but few doubted that the moment marked a turning point from which simple return to the previous state of affairs would be difficult, perhaps impossible.</p>','cat'=>'Lifestyle','author'=>'Jake Morrison','img'=>'','tags'=>['Health','Wellness','Fitness'],'date'=>'2024-04-21 18:42:00'],
        ['id'=>11182,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>3056,'title'=>'Loneliness Epidemic: Saudi Arabia Million Adults Report No Close Friends','exc'=>'Nutritionists welcomed the findings while cautioning that individual responses vary significantly and that sweeping dietary recommendations based on population data can be misleading.','body'=>'<p>Few anticipated the scale of what was about to unfold when the first reports emerged. Within hours, the story had drawn international attention and sparked a conversation that showed no signs of abating.</p><p>Experts who had been monitoring the area said the situation had been building for some time and that those with the clearest view had long warned that the status quo was unsustainable.</p><p>The response from institutions was cautious but pointed, with carefully worded statements that acknowledged the gravity of the situation without committing to specific action.</p><p>Looking ahead, the consensus among observers was that the coming weeks would be decisive, with outcomes likely to shape the landscape in this area for years to come.</p>','cat'=>'Lifestyle','author'=>'Grace O\'Brien','img'=>'','tags'=>['Fashion','Style','Trends'],'date'=>'2022-06-03 05:08:00'],
