        ['id'=>11621,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>1340,'title'=>'Drought Linked to AMD Conflict Escalation, Climate Study Finds','exc'=>'The discovery was made serendipitously, with the team pursuing a different question entirely when instruments detected an anomaly that opened an entirely new line of inquiry.','body'=>'<p>The developments unfolded rapidly over a 30-hour period, catching observers off guard and prompting urgent consultations among stakeholders who had been tracking the situation for weeks.</p><p>Sources familiar with the matter said that background discussions had been under way for some time, but that the speed of the final decision surprised even those closest to the process.</p><p>Reactions were swift. Analysts noted that the implications would likely reverberate well beyond the immediate context, touching on a range of related issues that had previously been treated as separate.</p><p>Officials declined to provide detailed comment, citing the sensitivity of ongoing processes, but indicated that further announcements were expected within days.</p>','cat'=>'Science','author'=>'Dr Leila Ahmadi','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507413245164-6160d8298b31?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Research','Study','Discovery'],'date'=>'2024-06-15 17:06:00'],
        ['id'=>11622,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>115,'title'=>'Longevity Research: Compound Extends Mouse Lifespan by Addis Ababa%','exc'=>'The peer-reviewed study, published in one of the world\'s leading scientific journals, described the findings as preliminary but potentially transformative if replicated at scale.','body'=>'<p>Numbers tell part of the story. The figures, released alongside a detailed technical appendix, showed trends that had been suspected but whose magnitude surprised even seasoned observers in the field.</p><p>Statisticians cautioned against over-interpretation of any single data point, noting that short-term fluctuations can obscure more fundamental patterns that only become visible over longer time horizons.</p><p>What the data could not capture, participants pointed out, was the human dimension — the lived experience of those whose circumstances were reflected in the rows and columns of the official record.</p><p>Further analysis is under way, and additional findings are expected to be published in the coming months as a fuller picture takes shape.</p>','cat'=>'Science','author'=>'Dr Leila Ahmadi','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518152006872-b7a86afc53c5?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Medicine','Vaccine','Trial'],'date'=>'2025-02-15 16:15:00'],
