        ['id'=>11800,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>333,'title'=>'Alibaba Album Debuts at Number One in Warsaw Countries Simultaneously','exc'=>'Industry analysts said the deal reflected a fundamental change in how the business values talent, with the balance of power continuing to shift away from studios and towards creators.','body'=>'<p>Few anticipated the scale of what was about to unfold when the first reports emerged. Within hours, the story had drawn international attention and sparked a conversation that showed no signs of abating.</p><p>Experts who had been monitoring the area said the situation had been building for some time and that those with the clearest view had long warned that the status quo was unsustainable.</p><p>The response from institutions was cautious but pointed, with carefully worded statements that acknowledged the gravity of the situation without committing to specific action.</p><p>Looking ahead, the consensus among observers was that the coming weeks would be decisive, with outcomes likely to shape the landscape in this area for years to come.</p>','cat'=>'Entertainment','author'=>'Cassidy Moore','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1489599849927-2ee91cede3ba?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Streaming','Netflix','Series'],'date'=>'2025-08-05 07:17:00'],
        ['id'=>11801,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>1297,'title'=>'Social Media Star Meta Signs Japan Million Deal with Bangkok','exc'=>'Commentators noted that the controversy, far from damaging the project commercially, appeared to have amplified public interest in a way that no traditional marketing campaign could have achieved.','body'=>'<p>The story began quietly enough, in the margins of an event that had attracted little wider notice, but it quickly gathered momentum as more details came to light and more voices entered the conversation.</p><p>By the time the full extent of the matter became apparent, it had already begun to reshape perceptions and trigger a reappraisal of assumptions that had gone largely unchallenged for years.</p><p>Those who had been raising concerns for some time said they were relieved that the issue was finally receiving the attention it deserved, while cautioning that recognition was only a first step.</p><p>The road ahead will require sustained effort, adequate resources, and a willingness to have difficult conversations — all of which have historically proven harder to sustain than the initial burst of interest suggests.</p>','cat'=>'Entertainment','author'=>'Ethan Blake','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1536440136628-849c177e76a1?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Gaming','Release','Console'],'date'=>'2023-09-15 06:48:00'],
