        ['id'=>11850,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>3274,'title'=>'New Season of Google Breaks Meta Viewing Record on Launch Day','exc'=>'Critics described the work as a cultural landmark, arguing that it captured something essential about the current moment in a way that defied easy categorisation or comparison.','body'=>'<p>The developments unfolded rapidly over a 8-hour period, catching observers off guard and prompting urgent consultations among stakeholders who had been tracking the situation for weeks.</p><p>Sources familiar with the matter said that background discussions had been under way for some time, but that the speed of the final decision surprised even those closest to the process.</p><p>Reactions were swift. Analysts noted that the implications would likely reverberate well beyond the immediate context, touching on a range of related issues that had previously been treated as separate.</p><p>Officials declined to provide detailed comment, citing the sensitivity of ongoing processes, but indicated that further announcements were expected within days.</p>','cat'=>'Entertainment','author'=>'Cassidy Moore','img'=>'','tags'=>['Awards','Oscar','Grammy'],'date'=>'2025-02-08 21:15:00'],
        ['id'=>11851,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>4683,'title'=>'Film Festival South Africa Sparks Controversy Over Tesla Selection','exc'=>'Long-term fans expressed mixed feelings, some celebrating the recognition while others worried that mainstream success would dilute the authenticity that had made the work so distinctive.','body'=>'<p>The story began quietly enough, in the margins of an event that had attracted little wider notice, but it quickly gathered momentum as more details came to light and more voices entered the conversation.</p><p>By the time the full extent of the matter became apparent, it had already begun to reshape perceptions and trigger a reappraisal of assumptions that had gone largely unchallenged for years.</p><p>Those who had been raising concerns for some time said they were relieved that the issue was finally receiving the attention it deserved, while cautioning that recognition was only a first step.</p><p>The road ahead will require sustained effort, adequate resources, and a willingness to have difficult conversations — all of which have historically proven harder to sustain than the initial burst of interest suggests.</p>','cat'=>'Entertainment','author'=>'Valentina Cruz','img'=>'','tags'=>['Streaming','Netflix','Series'],'date'=>'2023-07-02 06:35:00'],
